      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "The original Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct encoder is used unchanged under Apache-2.0.\nSingle-file weights: `Comfy-Org/Krea-2`, revision `eb1eddd3983a54678545a9b2c178c5853b30f7be`, `text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors`.\nThe upstream model is `Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct`. This package includes only the encoder, not the Krea2 denoiser weights. SHA-256 and size are recorded in `generation-defaults.json`.\nThe SDK mounts the original `model.language_model` namespace in memory. It does not rewrite the file or change tensor precision.\n"
    }
